{"unit_id":"xiaoyi-xx__dsh-peak-status#card-zh","repo":"xiaoyi-xx/dsh-peak-status","commit":"48d404c241d6cecaedb146b65bfe59366ec97c92","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak-status 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的 DeepSeek 峰谷时段指示插件。它把状态胶囊接入会话头部工具栏，并由 host 路由提供节假日历。胶囊显示北京时间、工作日高峰或谷价状态、价格提示和到下一时段的倒计时；点击可查看时段详情、节假日信息和阶段进度。日历优先从两个公开来源获取并缓存，浏览器端也有直连与普通周末规则的回退。适合使用 DeepSeek API、希望在 DSH 页面快速判断当前价格时段的用户；不需要额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:451","lib/client.js:497","lib/client.js:585","lib/index.js:199"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoyi-xx__dsh-peak-status#card-en","repo":"xiaoyi-xx/dsh-peak-status","commit":"48d404c241d6cecaedb146b65bfe59366ec97c92","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-peak-status adds a pricing chip to the DSH Web session header. It shows Beijing time, DeepSeek peak or off-peak status, a price hint, and a countdown. Clicking opens schedule details and phase progress. Holiday data is cached with fallback rules. No extra configuration is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:451","lib/client.js:497","lib/client.js:585","lib/index.js:199"]}
