{"unit_id":"xiaoyi-xx__dsh-peak-status#feature-1","repo":"xiaoyi-xx/dsh-peak-status","commit":"48d404c241d6cecaedb146b65bfe59366ec97c92","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak-status 的功能「北京时间峰谷状态」：会话头部胶囊按北京时间显示工作日峰谷状态和实时钟表；每秒刷新，并将周末、法定节假日及调休日按全天谷价处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:395"]}
