{"unit_id":"xiaoyi-xx__dsh-peak-status#feature-4","repo":"xiaoyi-xx/dsh-peak-status","commit":"48d404c241d6cecaedb146b65bfe59366ec97c92","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak-status 的功能「节假日日历同步」：插件 host 通过同源路由获取并缓存节假日历；浏览器端可直连备用来源，日历不可用时回退到普通周末规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:99"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoyi-xx__dsh-peak-status#caveat-1","repo":"xiaoyi-xx/dsh-peak-status","commit":"48d404c241d6cecaedb146b65bfe59366ec97c92","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak-status 使用前须知：插件会向 api.jiejiariapi.com 与 api.apihubs.cn 请求节假日日历，并将结果缓存在 host 内存或浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:99","lib/client.js:113","lib/client.js:149"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoyi-xx__dsh-peak-status#caveat-2","repo":"xiaoyi-xx/dsh-peak-status","commit":"48d404c241d6cecaedb146b65bfe59366ec97c92","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak-status 使用前须知：dsh-peak-status 在节假日日历不可用时会回退为普通工作日与周末规则，因此特殊节假日和调休日信息可能无法参与状态判断。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:132","lib/client.js:272"]}
